# Reads the install image's metadata straight out of a disc image, in a child process the media
# scan starts (guest_engine/media/reading.py): nothing is mounted. Pure Python, no dependencies, so the
# wheel's hash is the only thing fetched. Pinned to the newest release that was a month old when this
# was pinned; the tests build their own discs with it, so a bump is exercised by `make test-cape`.
